msgid ""
msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Orbit 1.0\nReport-Msgid-Bugs-To: \nPOT-Creation-Date: 2026-10-29 20:47+0800\nPO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-29 21:00+0800\nLast-Translator: junjunlab\nLanguage: zh_CN\nLanguage-Team: zh_CN <LL@li.org>\nPlural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nGenerated-By: Babel 2.18.0\n"

msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "导航"

msgid "Search a gene or an exact interval, then choose how much detail to display. Coordinates typed into Orbit are **1-based, inclusive**. The examples below use **human hg38 / GRCh38**; do not reuse them on hg19."
msgstr "搜索基因或精确区间，然后选择要显示的详细程度。在 Orbit 中输入的坐标采用 从 1 开始且包含首尾 的格式。下面示例使用 人类 hg38 / GRCh38 ；请勿在 hg19 上复用这些坐标。"

msgid "Search and zoom"
msgstr "搜索与缩放"

msgid "Select **hg38** in the assembly menu."
msgstr "在装配菜单中选择  hg38 。"

msgid "Type ``EGFR`` and press :kbd:`Enter` to open the gene. Select a suggestion when several names match; entering the same text again is not a next-hit command."
msgstr "输入 ``EGFR`` 并按  :kbd:`Enter`  打开该基因。如果有多个名称匹配，请选择建议项；再次输入相同文本不会跳转到下一个匹配项。"

msgid "Paste ``chr7:55,019,250-55,019,308`` to inspect its start-codon region."
msgstr "粘贴 ``chr7:55,019,250-55,019,308`` 查看其起始密码子区域。"

msgid "Use the wheel or toolbar zoom controls to change scale. Drag a track to pan; dragging is not an interval-selection gesture. Double-click to zoom in around the pointer. :kbd:`/` focuses the search box."
msgstr "使用滚轮或工具栏缩放控件调整比例。拖动轨道可平移；拖动不是选择区间的操作。双击可围绕指针放大。 :kbd:`/`  聚焦搜索框。"

msgid "The search also accepts ``chr7``, ``chr7:55,019,278``, and coordinate ranges without thousands separators. Zooming below one base per pixel is supported; this is necessary to make individual base letters readable. See :doc:`sequence` for nucleotide and amino-acid views."
msgstr "搜索还接受 ``chr7``、``chr7:55,019,278`` 以及不带千位分隔符的坐标范围。支持缩放到每像素少于一个碱基，这是读清单个碱基字母所必需的。有关核苷酸和氨基酸视图，请参阅  :doc:`sequence` 。"

msgid "ACTB locus showing the toolbar, track labels and gene model"
msgstr "显示工具栏、轨道标签和基因模型的 ACTB 位点"

msgid "A complete locus view. The assembly and search controls are at the top; track settings are beside the drawing, and the sidebar holds visibility switches and the selected-gene details."
msgstr "完整的位点视图。顶部是装配和搜索控件；绘图旁是轨道设置，侧边栏包含可见性开关和所选基因的详细信息。"

msgid "Expand and collapse a gene"
msgstr "展开和折叠基因"

msgid "Search ``EGFR``. In the RefSeq drawing, find the small **+** beside its label. Clicking the gene body or name selects it; it does not by itself expand it."
msgstr "搜索 ``EGFR``。在 RefSeq 绘图中找到标签旁的小  + 。点击基因主体或名称会选中它，但不会因此展开。"

msgid "Click **+** to show the individual transcript rows. The symbol becomes **−**."
msgstr "点击  +  显示各条转录本行。该符号会变为  − 。"

msgid "Compare transcript accessions (for example ``NM_005228``), exon blocks, intron connectors and coding regions. Different isoforms can have different exon structures and CDS boundaries."
msgstr "比较转录本登录号（例如 ``NM_005228``）、外显子块、内含子连接线和编码区域。不同异构体可能具有不同的外显子结构和 CDS 边界。"

msgid "Click **−** in the same place to collapse the transcript rows back to the merged gene model. A gene with only one transcript has no +/− expansion control."
msgstr "在同一位置点击  − ，将转录本行折叠回合并的基因模型。只有一条转录本的基因没有 +/− 展开控件。"

msgid "EGFR collapsed to a merged gene model with its plus control"
msgstr "折叠为合并基因模型并显示加号控件的 EGFR"

msgid "Before expansion: one merged EGFR model. Use the small + control, not an arbitrary point on an exon, to open the transcript list."
msgstr "展开前：一个合并的 EGFR 模型。请使用小 + 控件打开转录本列表，不要点击外显子上的任意位置。"

msgid "EGFR expanded into separate named transcript rows"
msgstr "展开为独立命名转录本行的 EGFR"

msgid "After expansion: EGFR isoforms occupy separate rows with their transcript accessions. The − control collapses them again; the locus and zoom are unchanged."
msgstr "展开后：EGFR 异构体占据独立行，并显示其转录本登录号。− 控件会再次折叠它们；位点和缩放保持不变。"

msgid "Expand or collapse the entire track"
msgstr "展开或折叠整个轨道"

msgid "Click the **gear beside RefSeq**, then choose **Expand all** or **Collapse all**. Expand all also applies to genes that become visible after panning. You can still collapse an individual gene using its − control. Imported GTF/GFF3 gene tracks have their own gear and independent expansion state. Shift-click is not an expand-all shortcut. Do not rely on expansion surviving a new app launch."
msgstr "点击  RefSeq 旁的齿轮 ，然后选择  Expand all  或  Collapse all 。Expand all 也会应用于平移后出现的基因。仍可使用某个基因的 − 控件单独折叠它。导入的 GTF/GFF3 基因轨道有自己的齿轮和独立展开状态。Shift-点击不是“全部展开”快捷方式。不要假定重新启动应用后仍会保留展开状态。"

msgid "Gene-track settings with Expand all and Collapse all buttons"
msgstr "包含 Expand all 和 Collapse all 按钮的基因轨道设置"

msgid "The actual gene-track settings: expansion controls and colours for strands, CDS and UTR. The setting affects the chosen track, not every annotation file."
msgstr "实际的基因轨道设置：包含链、CDS 和 UTR 的展开控件及颜色。该设置只影响所选轨道，不会影响每个注释文件。"

msgid "Feature details at the pointer"
msgstr "指针位置的结构详情"

msgid "Right-click a gene model in **RefSeq** or in an imported GTF/GFF3 track. The popover names what is exactly under the pointer:"
msgstr "在 **RefSeq** 或导入的 GTF/GFF3 轨道上右键基因结构，浮层会说明指针正下方到底是什么："

msgid "Right-clicking the first exon of ``MTHFR`` (minus strand). The pointer is on exon 12 of 12 — numbering follows the transcript, so the leftmost exon is the last one on a minus-strand gene. The 3′ UTR fragment and the intron count are listed below it."
msgstr "在 ``MTHFR`` （负链）第一个外显子上右键。指针处是第 12 个外显子 / 共 12 个——编号按转录方向，所以负链基因最左边的外显子是最后一个。下面是 3′ UTR 片段和内含子总数。"

msgid "The fields are:"
msgstr "字段含义："

msgid "**Gene name** and **Gene ID**. The ID is shown only when the annotation stores one; the bundled RefSeq index keeps names, so it reads *not provided* there."
msgstr "**基因名称** 与 **基因 ID**。只有注释里带 ID 时才显示；内置 RefSeq 索引只保留名称，所以那里显示「未提供」。"

msgid "**Transcript ID** and **strand**. A position covered by several transcripts lists one block per transcript instead of picking one."
msgstr "**转录本 ID** 与 **链方向**。一个位置被多个转录本覆盖时，每个转录本各列一块，不会随便挑一个。"

msgid "**Exon**, **CDS fragment**, **5′/3′ UTR fragment** or **intron**, each as *n of m*, with its 1-based inclusive interval and its length."
msgstr "**外显子**、**CDS 片段**、**5′/3′ UTR 片段** 或 **内含子**，都标成 *第 n 个 / 共 m 个*，并给出 1 基、含两端的区间和长度。"

msgid "**Total introns** for that transcript."
msgstr "该转录本的 **内含子总数**。"

msgid "Intervals are 1-based and inclusive, matching the search box; the underlying model is 0-based half-open. CDS and UTR fragments are derived from the exon list plus the CDS start/end of the transcript, so their numbering is the fragment number in this model, not the feature number in the original file."
msgstr "区间是 1 基、含两端，和搜索框一致；底层模型是 0 基半开。CDS 与 UTR 片段由外显子列表加转录本的 CDS 起止推导而来，所以序号是当前模型里的片段序号，不是原始文件里的 feature 编号。"

msgid "Every intron, not only the one under the pointer"
msgstr "全部内含子，而不只是指针下的那一个"

msgid "The list of introns is collapsed by default. Opening it shows all of them in transcript order with coordinates and lengths, so you can read a splice structure without hunting for each gap:"
msgstr "内含子清单默认折叠。展开后按转录方向列出全部内含子的区间与长度，不用再逐个空隙去找："

msgid "All 11 introns of ``NM_001330358``, numbered from the 5′ end of the transcript. The entry under the pointer is bold."
msgstr "``NM_001330358`` 的全部 11 个内含子，从转录本 5′ 端开始编号；指针所在的那条加粗。"

msgid "Hovering an intron without clicking shows the same information in a tooltip:"
msgstr "不点开也能看：把鼠标停在内含子上，提示里是同样的信息："

msgid "``Intron 11 of 11 · chr1:11,790,899–11,791,206 · 308 bp``. One line per transcript when several share the position."
msgstr "``内含子 第 11 个 / 共 11 个 · chr1:11,790,899–11,791,206 · 308 bp``。同一位置有多个转录本时，每个转录本一行。"

msgid "The popover can be dragged by its title bar and stays inside the window; its content scrolls when the intron list is long."
msgstr "浮层可以用标题栏拖动，并始终留在窗口内；内含子很多时内容区自己滚动。"

msgid "Compare several genes in panels"
msgstr "在多个面板中比较基因"

msgid "Orbit supports **1–5 panels**. Loci and zoom levels are independent; track files and track-level settings are shared. A panel is not a separate sample import."
msgstr "Orbit 支持  1–5 个面板 。各面板的位点和缩放级别相互独立；轨道文件及轨道级设置共享。面板不是独立的样本导入。"

msgid "Two-panel example: ACTB and EGFR"
msgstr "双面板示例：ACTB 和 EGFR"

msgid "Open **Split view** in the toolbar and choose **2 panels**."
msgstr "在工具栏打开  Split view ，选择  2 panels 。"

msgid "In the position input above the first panel, type ``ACTB`` and press Enter."
msgstr "在第一个面板上方的位置输入框中输入 ``ACTB`` 并按 Enter。"

msgid "In the second panel input, type ``EGFR`` and press Enter."
msgstr "在第二个面板的输入框中输入 ``EGFR`` 并按 Enter。"

msgid "Zoom or pan within one panel to compare detail without moving the other. Click its header to select the target panel for shared toolbar navigation."
msgstr "在一个面板中缩放或平移以比较细节，不会移动另一个面板。点击其标题可选择目标面板，供共享工具栏导航使用。"

msgid "Use the **×** in a panel header to close that panel, or choose one panel in the split menu to return to a single view."
msgstr "点击面板标题中的  ×  关闭该面板，或在分屏菜单中选择单个面板返回单视图。"

msgid "ACTB and EGFR displayed in two independent genomic panels"
msgstr "在两个独立基因组面板中显示的 ACTB 和 EGFR"

msgid "ACTB (negative strand) and EGFR (positive strand) in two panels. Each has its own position field and coordinate scale: aligned screen columns do not mean the same genomic coordinate."
msgstr "两个面板中的 ACTB（负链）和 EGFR（正链）。每个面板都有自己的位置输入框和坐标比例：屏幕上对齐的列不表示相同的基因组坐标。"

msgid "Four-panel example"
msgstr "四面板示例"

msgid "Choose **4 panels**, then enter ``ACTB``, ``EGFR``, ``TP53`` and ``MYC`` in their respective header inputs. Alternatively, enter ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` in the main search box to open multiple loci. Check the pane count and gene names before exporting. Ctrl+number is not a supported panel-focus shortcut."
msgstr "选择  4 panels ，然后在相应标题输入框中输入 ``ACTB``、``EGFR``、``TP53`` 和 ``MYC``。也可以在主搜索框中输入 ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` 以打开多个位点。导出前检查面板数量和基因名称。Ctrl+数字不是受支持的面板聚焦快捷键。"

msgid "Four panels comparing ACTB EGFR TP53 and MYC"
msgstr "比较 ACTB、EGFR、TP53 和 MYC 的四个面板"

msgid "Four real gene loci side by side. The view makes gene structures easy to compare, while every panel retains its own zoom and chromosome."
msgstr "四个真实基因位点并排显示。该视图便于比较基因结构，同时每个面板保留自己的缩放和染色体。"

msgid "Whole-genome overview and links"
msgstr "全基因组总览与链接"

msgid "Enable the whole-genome overview from the sidebar track list. Its chevron expands the primary-chromosome bars; their count depends on the chosen species. Click a bar to navigate. In split view each panel draws its own overview and current-window marker."
msgstr "在侧边栏轨道列表中启用全基因组总览。点击其箭头可展开主染色体条；条数取决于所选物种。点击某条即可导航。在分屏视图中，每个面板都会绘制自己的总览和当前窗口标记。"

msgid "In browser mode a locus can be opened with a URL such as::"
msgstr "在浏览器模式下，可以使用如下 URL 打开位点："

msgid "Use the search box inside the native desktop window when no address bar is shown."
msgstr "桌面原生窗口不显示地址栏时，请使用窗口内的搜索框。"
